bundenheit, die von Herzen kommt, edler Haltung und Eleganz ausstrahlt.","meaning_ar":"Evîn؛ شخصية مميزة وثمينة للغاية تشع حبًا وجمالاً بقلب مليء بـ تعني حباً، مودة، حديثاً وارتباطاً كبيراً نابعاً من القلب، وتتميز بوقارها ورقّتها."},"addLabel":"Deftere Ekle","removeLabel":"Defterden Çıkar","size":20}]]}],["$","hr",null,{"style":{"border":0,"borderTop":"1px solid var(--border)","margin":"1.5rem 0"}}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"0.85rem","fontWeight":800,"textTransform":"uppercase","letterSpacing":"0.06em","color":"var(--text-muted)","marginBottom":"0.5rem"},"children":"Anlamı"}],["$","p",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"1.15rem","lineHeight":1.75,"color":"var(--text)","margin":0,"fontWeight":500},"children":"Evîn; aşk, sevgi, muhabbet ve kalpten gelen büyük bağlılık olup, dolu kalbi, asil duruşu ve zarafetiyle etrafına sevgi ve güzellik saçan, çok özel ve kıymetli bir kimsedir."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"style":{"marginTop":"1.75rem"},"children":["$","table",null,{"className":"infobox","style":{"width":"100%","maxWidth":"460px","float":"none","margin":0},"children":["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":"Cinsiyet"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"Kız"}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":"Köken"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"Kürtçe"}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":"Harf"}],["$","td",null,{"children":["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/tr/kategori/e","children":"E"}]}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":"Harf Sayısı"}],["$","td",null,{"children":[4," ","harf"]}]]}]]}]}]}]]}]
